  "scientific_limits": [
    "No confirmed hydrologic negative control is created from absence of reported damage.",
    "La Capilla station observations are not transferred as discharge, stage or channel-capacity truth at downstream impact reaches without event-specific hydraulic validation.",
    "The 2017, 2021, 2023, 2024 and 2025 positive outcomes do not have repository-grade same-day La Capilla flow paired to each impact event in this evidence package.",
    "Provider alert bands are source/date-specific operational context, not IRFEN decision thresholds. The red band is 110 m3/s in the cited 2024 product and 130 m3/s in the cited 2026 bulletin, demonstrating that source alert bands are not assumed temporally invariant.",
    "The 2023 huaico-to-river-overflow sequence is a compound event and is not generalized into a single river-flood or debris-flow rule.",
    "The ANA river-margin definition and critical-point material support spatial context but are not observed flood footprints or complete basin geometry."
  ],
